"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4806630","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4530520-1846651706685333","game_id":"steam-4530520","kind":"announcement","title":"HOW MANY BUGS? All of the bugs.","summary":"Few bug fixes that were brought to our attention! Sorry =)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T18:51:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4530520-1846651706680080","game_id":"steam-4530520","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO 2.0 IS HERE!","summary":"HELLO EVERYONE!The time is finally here, the highly anticipated major update to the Hostile Entity Demo. We are excited to announce a plethora of new mechanics a features!STORYLINE:New missions / quests given to you by NPCs.Puzzles added to levels to enhance difficulty.Lore items containing story dialogues scattered about.COMBAT:GUNS! Big and small, experience the firepower of the T.R.C.OTrain your combat abilities in the T.R.C.O Training Center!Enhanced enemy and Boss AI making combat more diff","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4530520-1832700592795356","game_id":"steam-4530520","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming Soon","summary":"Hey everybody! Thank you to those who participated in the playtest we really appreciate everyone who came through on that for us! That being said the demo will be releasing early next month! We are going to show off 10 levels and 3 boss's with some more new features we've implemented! NOTE: Everything is still subject to change as we work on the project, we have many more plans to implement more items, inventory systems, events, and more. AS OF NOW the game is up to 27 levels and multiple boss's","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-17T02:32:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592795356","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4530520-1831432155577558","game_id":"steam-4530520","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming Soon","summary":"Hey everyone! We are happy to announce that in June we will be releasing a FREE demo to the public!While our playtest is running players who've got access are encouraged to join the discord to report any bugs we may have missed https://discord.gg/M5mr9wpr . The demo will consist of a large portion of the full game stopping after a certain level, players will have access to everything we've been working on. However note that all things are subject to change and adjustments as we continue to work ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T14:32:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4530520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:51:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:51:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4530520":"2026-10-26T12:51:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4530520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:51:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:51:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:51:16Z"},"4806630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:51:17Z","last_success_at":"